'''Assault! Head, Aoshi Shinomori''' (強襲！御頭・四乃森蒼紫, ''Kyōshū! Okashira・Shinomori Aoshi'', '''Assault! Head, Aoshi Shinomori''') is a [[Rurouni Kenshin Collaboration Event|Rurouni Kenshin]] collaboration stage added in the [[Version 13.4 Update]]. This [[Gauntlet]] features many enemies from the collab.

==Overview==
===About===
Assault! Head, Aoshi Shinomori contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Oniwabanshu Lv'''. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Floor can include XP, [[Catfruit]], [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], [[Ototo Corps|Materials]], and [[Catamin]]s. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Aoshi Shinomori Strikes!/Oniwaban Group Lv.1~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Assault! Head, Aoshi Shinomori is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3.

